["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もうすぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不久；即将；很快；差不多；几乎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80708\"><ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るくなってきた。もうすぐ<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It&#x27;s getting light. Morning is coming.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もし</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">如果；假如；倘若</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193542\">もし<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がなったら<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てくれますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">If the telephone rings, can you answer it?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もちろん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">当然；自然；当然了</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217215\">「ご<ruby>一緒<rp>(</rp><rt>いっしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してもいいですか」「もちろんです」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;May I go with you?&quot; &quot;Of course.&quot;</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もっとも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><