</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">温柔；温和；温情；柔和；体贴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194969\">みんなには<ruby>優<rp>(</rp><rt>やさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しく<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Speak gently to everyone.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">痩せる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变瘦；减肥；消瘦；（土壤）变贫瘠；变不毛；变荒芜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91287\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はレールのように<ruby>痩<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She was as thin as a rail.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:やっと\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">终于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">やっと<ruby>宿題<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">作业终于写完了。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やはり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">果然；不出所料；正如所想；终究；到底；结果上；不出意料；也；同样；亦；同理；依然；依旧；仍然；即便如此；纵然；还是；仍然</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193053\">やっぱり<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とかやってのけたね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You managed it after all.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">止む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">停止；中止；结束</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189841\"><ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がちょうど<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ、<ruby>出発<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっぱつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The rain just stopped, so let&#x27;s leave.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">柔らかい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やわらかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">柔软的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">柔</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">热水；热浴；温泉；熔铁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229328\">いい<ruby>湯<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だなあ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Ah, this hot water&#x27;s good!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">輸出</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆしゅつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">出口；出口贸易；传出的；输出的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199679\">ドル<ruby>安<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>輸出<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはずみをつけています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The cheap dollar is charging up exports.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">輸入</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆにゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">进口；引进；（生物）传入的（神经、血管等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218574\">これはドイツから<ruby>輸入<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This is a car imported from Germany.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">指</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">手指；脚趾；趾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201873\">ドアに<ruby>指<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはさみました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I caught my finger in the door.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">指輪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆびわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">戒指；指环</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221740\">この<ruby>指輪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆびわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をある<ruby>場所<rp>(</rp><rt>ばしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I bought this ring at a certain place.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">梦；梦境；梦；希望；愿望；志向；抱负；不切实际的幻想；白日梦；空想；妄想；幻觉；错觉；转瞬即逝的事物；昙花一现的东西</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233006\">あなたの<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がみんな<ruby>実現<rp>(</rp><rt>じつげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されますように。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">May all your dreams come true!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揺れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ゆれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">摇晃；摇摆；摇动；颤动；抖动；颠簸；摇曳；闪烁；动摇；不稳定；不安定；摇摆不定；犹豫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137399\"><ruby>大地<rp>(</rp><rt>だいち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>揺<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるのが<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The earth was felt to tremble.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" 