./n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变脏；弄脏；蒙垢；堕落；失贞</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220022\">この<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>空気<rp>(</rp><rt>くうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>汚<rp>(</rp><rt>よご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The air in this room is foul.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">予習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">预习</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79019\"><ruby>予習<rp>(</rp><rt>よしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>ほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいいですよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You may as well begin to prepare your lessons.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:予定\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">予定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">预定；安排</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>週末<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まっていません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">周末的安排还没定。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">予約</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よやく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">预约；预订；提前订购；合同；订阅；约定；程序设定；设置（如计时器）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"236436\">「ホテルの<ruby>予約<rp>(</rp><rt>よやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はしてありますか」「すみませんが、まだなんです」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">&quot;Have you reserved a hotel room?&quot; &quot;Sorry, not yet.&quot;</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">寄る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接近；靠近；走近；聚集；集合；汇聚；顺路拜访；顺道造访；中途停留；变老；（数字等）增加；起皱；产生皱纹；靠着；倚靠；斜靠；抱住对手腰带推动（相扑技法）；商定价格；成交；受（某人）左右；屈从；顺从</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175265\"><ruby>犬<rp>(</rp><rt>いぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るなり<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">No sooner had the dog seen me than it ran up to me.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">喜ぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">よろこぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">高兴；欣喜；愉快；喜悦；祝贺；道贺；欢迎；乐于接受；乐意（做）；欣然（做）；高兴（做）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183538\"><ruby>喜<rp>(</rp><rt>よろこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>答<rp>(</rp><rt>こた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えましょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;ll be happy to answer your question.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">よろしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">好的；可以；没问题；行；不妨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233649\">あなたに<ruby>頼<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでもよろしいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">May I request a favour of you?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:理由\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">理由</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">りゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">理由</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>遅<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた<ruby>理由<rp>(</rp><rt>りゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>説明<rp>(</rp><rt>せつめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">请说明迟到的理由。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">両親</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">りょうしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">父母</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">親</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">両方</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">りょうほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=